					"content": "蒲公英…還有這個烤鬆餅是怎麼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700090805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "維克多"
				},
				{
					"id": 700090805,
					"content": "是禮物吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700090806
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700090806,
					"content": "禮、禮物？蒲公英就只剩下一條莖，還有這烤鬆餅…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700090807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "維克多"
				},
				{
